In a previous article, mikefitz@beach.csulb.edu (Mike Fitzpatrick) says:

>Hi everyone.  I am relatively new to the game of hack and I have 
>frequently come across a whistle that I can find no use for.  Can
>anyone help me out?  Also what can you do with a kitchen sink?

Basic spoilers follow:


Whistles are used to attract pets.  If you apply a whistle and it
produces a high whistling sound, it will attract your pets (and monsters
as well).  Magic whistles (they produce a strange whistling sound) are m
uch more useful, as they will teleport your pets right next to you.

You can do a lot with a sink:

You can quaff from one.  Kind of risky

If you levitate over one, you will fall to the ground (careful, I died
this way once!)

If you drop a ring down a sink, you can identify the type of ring by the
effect produced on the sink.  Unfortunately, you will lose the ring most
of the time.

You can kick a sink.  Usually nothing happens.  You may cause it to
disgorge a ring.  Another think that could happen is that a black
pudding will be disgorged.  If you know what you're doing, you can use
this to your advantage, but black puddings can be dangerous and will
wipe out a weak character in a hurry.

Hope this helps

